      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "This presents a classic trade-off between immediate sales and long-term brand building. You can argue for this success by framing the campaign as a massive \"top-of-funnel\" awareness investment, not a direct sales driver. Focus your presentation on the high reach, the brand share increase, and the high volume of potential future leads generated. This strategic approach should convince the board that the spend built valuable, durable brand equity for future conversions.",
